WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:31.650
You can see all the action!

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:32.820
Look!

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:38.510
A Gundam...

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:48.580
Awesome!

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.210
There's nothing like
a real Gundam!

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:54.110
Look!
That's Gundam Zebra!

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.840
And that one's
Gundam Maxter.

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:59.430
Attacking power, 26.79 points.

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:02.220
A top-class Gundam
with an A-rating.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:04.010
Isn't that right, Chan?

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:06.140
Chan!

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:08.600
It's dangerous to go
past the barriers!

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.440
A Gundam...

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:15.730
One day...

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:17.740
...I'm going to pilot a real Gundam.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:19.900
For sure!

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:23.800
That feeling of admiring the strong.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.510
That feeling of admiring
what's cool.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.830
I'm sure you've all
experienced that.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:33.580
The sense of adoration that
everyone has when they're young.

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:35.290
Yes.

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:37.420
In the case of this boy, Chan...

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:41.380
...his yearning to pilot a Gundam
is nothing more than adoration.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.890
But this time around...

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:48.100
...this adoration will cause
Domon to suffer in his match...

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.140
...against Cobra Gundam
of Neo India.

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:52.770
And now!

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:56.210
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:02.910
Hang on, Domon!
Triumph of the Restored Faith

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.850
That wasn't much
of a match.

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:17.300
Gundam Maxter was
stronger by a long shot.

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:21.300
The deep strength of the glorious
Neo America came through.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:21.970
Now...

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:32.810
The God Gundam's
second round match...

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.480
As you promised me...

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.500
...I would appreciate it if you'd
set him up with a tough opponent.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:38.980
Well, then...

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.690
...how do you feel
about this opponent?

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:45.110
I see.

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:46.700
This should be very interesting.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.500
Then, I think we're all set.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.830
The God Gundam's
next opponent is...

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:56.710
...Cobra Gundam of Neo India.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:04.930
Get this.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:06.010
And this.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:06.800
And this!

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:07.760
And this.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:08.470
And this.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:09.060
Hey.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.520
You're not planning to
get any more?

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:13.430
It's all because you eat a lot,
Domon.

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:14.980
Mister, this too, please.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.150
Sure thing.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:19.110
That'll be
500 Neo Hong Kong dollars.

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:20.480
Come on. You heard him, Domon.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.150
I'm paying for all this?

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:25.200
I thought you considered me a guest.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.490
We are friends, right?

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.410
Why can't you pay sometimes?

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:29.950
Friends, huh?

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:31.870
I promise we'll treat you
the next time.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.710
So don't be such a geek.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.760
Something wrong, Domon?

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:48.850
Well, I thought that
somebody was watching me.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:50.220
That's just how it is.

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:54.310
Gundam Fighters are famous.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:56.140
No sense getting worried about it.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.600
Are you sure about that?

00:04:58.860 --> 00:04:59.900
You bet.

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:01.110
I'm totally sure.

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:04.570
So, Domon is considered
famous here.

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:07.030
Well, it doesn't feel so bad.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.080
Hey, did you see him?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:11.990
It's true.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:15.250
Hoy was right.
He really is a Gundam Fighter.

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:18.170
He really is friends
with a Gundam Fighter.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.590
That guy's Domon Kasshu!

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:23.210
Remember? He bragged that
he'd sweep the tournament!

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:25.880
Must be nice.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:29.140
I bet Hoy gets to see
his Gundam a lot.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:33.220
Maybe he's even taken Hoy
to see inside the Gundam.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.350
"Inside the Gundam"?

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:39.920
You'll get yours, Hoy.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.070
Huh?

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.610
Rain! You go ahead!

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:45.650
Hey, you! Hiding there!

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:48.280
Don't you dare move!

00:05:54.710 --> 00:05:55.800
Huh?

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:00.710
Who are you?!

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.710
Who's been following me around?!

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.710
Show yourself!

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:14.220
Where are you?!

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:15.930
Where're you hiding?!

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:31.570
Domon Kasshu.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:34.030
This is where you're going to die.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:38.910
You don't expect to defeat me...

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.830
...with that monster cobra of yours,
do you?

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.880
Shall we give it a try?

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:47.300
Gimme a break!

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:56.970
Gotcha!

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:11.700
Well? Can't seem to move?

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:15.530
Why, you!

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:17.410
Who the hell are you?!

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:20.760
There's no reason for me to
tell you who I am.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.230
Why should I?

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.590
It's because you're
going to die here.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:31.630
There's no sense trying to
escape from this.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:32.550
Hey!

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.550
Domon!

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:43.940
Domon!

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.020
Are you all right, Domon?

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:47.480
Yeah.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:48.520
Thanks a lot.

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:49.730
You helped me out.

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.200
Are you really going to be okay?

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:53.700
Yeah.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.160
I'll be just fine.

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:58.410
What a drag.
That guy's really weak.

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.910
Aren't you going to talk to him,
Chan?

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:01.620
Of course not.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:04.870
If he's a weak fighter,
it's a totally different story.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:10.340
Something's wrong if they have
Fighters who're that weak.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:12.470
You're right.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:16.300
If he's that bad, maybe you can
pilot the Gundam better than him.

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:19.010
I know.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:20.930
I've got a great idea.

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:24.190
If it works out, I might be
able to pilot a Gundam!

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:25.100
Hey.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.440
Come a little closer.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.480
Come on. You too.

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:36.780
So...

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.780
I see you found yourself
in quite a pickle.

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:40.990
Yeah.

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:43.120
I didn't expect to be attacked
while in the city.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.580
We're all set to go here, Domon.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.960
What are you doing there?

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:50.460
We're checking to see
if the guy...

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.630
...who attacked me today
is a Gundam Fighter.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:53.880
I've got it.

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.260
Cobra Gundam of Neo India.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.970
This is how he fought his
opponent in the first round.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:02.720
Same technique.

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:04.140
Who's the Fighter?

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:05.060
One moment.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:07.230
I knew it.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.770
Shijiema of Neo India.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.280
From what I gather,
he's my next opponent.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:13.280
But...

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:17.030
...how was he able to get that
information before we did?

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:18.280
Don't worry.

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.820
Just knowing that he's strong...

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:21.120
...is helpful enough.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:22.080
Okay.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:24.370
I'll be working on the God Gundam...

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.080
...so give me a call
when dinner's ready.

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.710
Speaking of dinner...

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:30.000
...Hoy went out to play,
so I'm short-handed.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.130
Can someone give me a hand?

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:33.920
Rain, this is a perfect opportunity.

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.760
Ming can teach you how to cook.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:36.880
What?!

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:38.340
What's this?!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:41.010
Are you suggesting that
I'm a bad cook?!

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:54.820
Hey.

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.110
Did Domon come?

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:56.780
No.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:57.570
Not yet.

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:01.780
Hoy, are you sure this is the
dock for the God Gundam?

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:03.790
Y-yeah...

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:06.620
You better not be telling me
any lies.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:07.460
Um...

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.540
...I don't want to do this.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.250
I don't want to trick Domon.

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.000
Don't change your mind now.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.000
But he's a friend.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.090
Hey!

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:19.180
Are you saying we're
not friends, then?

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:22.180
So, you want to be left
out of our group?

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.930
I-I wouldn't like that, but...

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:26.180
All right, then.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:28.690
Just do exactly what I tell you.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:29.730
Got that?

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:31.570
Okay...

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:32.860
He's here!

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:34.020
It's Domon Kasshu!

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:48.540
Now...

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.000
...let's get into action!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:58.050
In order to counter
Shijiema's moves...

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:01.380
...I've got to synchronize better
with the God Gundam.

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:03.300
Okay!

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:04.470
Go ahead!

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:05.470
Right.

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:09.890
Domon!

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:11.770
Domon!

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:15.150
We have a big problem!

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:16.570
What is it?!

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.730
Something wrong?!

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:21.400
I told you! We have a big problem!

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:23.240
That doesn't tell me anything.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.030
What happened?

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:25.740
Like I said...

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:26.700
Out with it.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:27.740
Tell me what happened.

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:29.500
Good job!

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.040
All right!

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:32.960
What the...?

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:33.930
Okay!

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.460
Yeah!

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:38.340
I'm going to borrow the Gundam!

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:39.800
Wha...?! Hey!

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.630
It'll be okay!

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.550
I won't damage it or anything!

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:44.300
Wait!

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.970
A kid in a Gundam spells
nothing but trouble!

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:49.470
Not true, you're lying!

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:50.430
Bye!

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:03.320
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:12.410
I never thought a kid would
try to highjack my Gundam!

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.120
Okay.

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:16.380
This Gundam belongs
to me now.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:18.000
Get out!

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.380
Turn off the switch right now!

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:20.760
Not a chance!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:23.010
It's all mine now.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:27.390
I-it hurts...!

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.810
N-no, wait!

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:32.640
Wait a minute!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.020
Oh, no!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:36.650
Chan!

00:12:39.010 --> 00:12:40.530
It's too hard for a kid like you!

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:41.860
Stay still and wait for me!

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:45.530
Hold on!

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:48.660
H-help me...!

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:56.000
Domon!

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:58.580
Domon!

00:12:58.580 --> 00:12:59.840
Are you okay?

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:04.920
Did you think you could ride the
God Gundam if you tricked me?!

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:07.680
Damn!

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.220
It must have happened when I fell.

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:10.680
Domon...

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:26.900
Don't move!

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:29.070
If you make a wrong move
you might crush your body.

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:31.250
I-I can't help it...

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:33.290
Relax your body!

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:42.420
It...

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.710
...it stopped.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:56.230
Tomorrow's match should
be a lot of fun...

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.390
...wouldn't you agree, Domon Kasshu?

00:13:58.390 --> 00:14:00.310
Shijiema!

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:01.770
What's he doing here?

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:02.820
Wait a minute.

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.800
Is he the one who's behind this?

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:13.030
Chan! Chan!

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:16.500
Chan! Say something, Chan!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:19.670
Chan!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:22.840
Answer me.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.460
Did that guy tell you to do this?

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:28.590
Did Shijiema tell you to do this?!

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:30.800
Well, uh...

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:34.680
I, uh...

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:37.390
Forget it.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:38.600
I've heard enough.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:40.940
Domon.

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:45.000
You see, I thought...

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:51.860
Domon...

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:55.580
Did he just hurt himself?

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:56.580
Uh, yeah...

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:58.330
...when he was trying to save you.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.650
What? I see.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:05.310
He got hurt because of me.

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:09.550
His next match is tomorrow, right?

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:12.050
<i>In today's first match</i>...

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.970
...<i>Gundam Rose of Neo France</i>...

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:16.560
...<i>defeated Nether Gundam</i>
<i>of Neo Holland</i>...

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.430
...<i>to earn two points</i>.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.100
<i>Our second match today</i>...

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:22.980
...<i>is to be held here at</i>
<i>the Victoria Peak Ring</i>.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:26.110
Okay. I'll be on my way.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.570
Domon...

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.070
What's wrong?

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:35.580
You seem down.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:36.490
Yeah.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.080
Aren't you going to cheer for him?

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.660
W-well...

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.330
I hope...

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.750
...he doesn't lose
because of the injury.

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:48.500
Now, Master East.
According to Shijiema...

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:50.760
...Domon seems
to have hurt himself...

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:52.430
Yeah?

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:55.970
But that might just prove
to be a good test for Domon.

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:58.970
Sure, if it's nothing
more than a test.

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:01.600
Now...

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:03.650
Shall we get started, Shijiema?

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:11.110
How's your injury treating you,
Domon Kasshu?

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.280
What?!

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.830
A Gundam coming out
of a pot?!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.170
Domon Kasshu...

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:30.710
...looks like I'll be the one to
put an end to your plan...

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:32.010
...to sweep the matches.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:35.470
Hold your tongue until you've
won the match!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:36.590
<i>So</i>...

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:39.680
...<i>Cobra Gundam is now</i>
<i>set up and ready for battle!</i>

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:41.930
<i>Which Gundam</i>
<i>will be victorious?!</i>

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:43.060
Very well!

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:45.650
And now, Gundam Fight!

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:47.400
Ready!

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:49.820
Go!

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:00.240
Domon!

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:01.450
<i>Whoa!</i>

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:03.790
<i>Cobra Gundam of Neo India</i>
<i>has attacked first!</i>

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:06.000
He keeps on hitting
Domon's injured shoulder.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:09.630
I'll keep hitting the spot
where you're hurting the most.

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:16.630
Domon!

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:18.590
Why, you!

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:25.310
What?!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:26.350
No way!

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.860
I've got you now, Domon Kasshu!

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:36.780
My, oh, my.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:41.080
For our sake, I certainly hope
he's not finished already.

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:44.080
Can you get out of this, Domon?

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:47.710
<i>Look at this!</i>

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.540
<i>God Gundam's in trouble!</i>

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:53.420
What's he doing?! At this rate,
he's going to lose the match!

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:54.960
Come on!

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:57.180
The plan was to sweep
and fight against Master!

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:58.380
Shut up!

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:00.890
I know that without you
having to tell me!

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:03.720
What's wrong with Domon?

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:06.070
Maybe he had an injury.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:11.900
It's my fault.
I'm the one who did this.

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:15.550
This is all my fault.

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:19.490
It's all my...

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:25.040
Chan!

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.710
- Domon!
- Why won't you do something?!

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:31.040
- You can get through this!
- Don't you dare lose!

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.710
Um, please...

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:35.420
...I want to talk to Domon!

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:37.920
We're right in the
middle of a match!

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:40.840
But it's real important! Please!

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:42.970
It's that important?

00:18:44.090 --> 00:18:44.970
All right.

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.640
Domon! Domon!

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:51.480
It's me! It's Hoy!

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:54.610
I'm busy!
Talk to me after the match is over!

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:55.780
Um, I...

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:58.110
...I want to say I'm sorry.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.200
I'm sorry that I lied to you.

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:04.120
I'm Chan, the kid who snuck
into your Gundam!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.620
The whole thing was my idea.

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:09.290
You weren't working with Shijiema?!

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:10.400
No way!

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:15.340
Just once, I wanted to
ride in a Gundam.

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:17.670
I'll never, ever, do it again.

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:18.510
So you've got to...

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:20.880
You've got to go for it!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:23.580
Please don't lose! Please!

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:25.290
Domon!

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:27.970
All right, then.

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.980
I just have to win, right?

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:38.050
It's about time I finish you off!

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:48.290
This guy!

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:49.870
He separated!

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:52.830
This'll be it.

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:56.290
I've got it!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:58.880
I remember. That time...

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:01.610
<i>Don't move!</i>

00:20:01.610 --> 00:20:04.490
<i>If you make a wrong move</i>
<i>you might crush your body</i>.

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:06.700
That's right!

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:08.000
I have a way out!

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.560
You're just wasting your energy.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:15.400
Domon!

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:23.530
Wha...?!

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:25.490
Dislocating his own shoulder?!

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:28.910
This gives me enough room
to escape!

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:36.540
This hand of mine is burning red!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:40.090
Its loud roar tells me
to grasp victory!

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:42.840
Here I go!

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:44.130
All right!

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.300
Do it now!

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:47.370
Erupting...

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:52.310
...God Finger!

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:59.900
Heat End!

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:04.820
All right!

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:07.450
<i>God Gundam has done it!</i>

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:10.410
<i>God Gundam has</i>
<i>defeated Cobra Gundam!</i>

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.780
He's made it past
the second round.

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:17.170
Are you pleased that he won?

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:18.540
Of course.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:20.900
My pupil has come
that much closer to me...

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:23.380
...in order to fight against me.

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:32.350
Domon!

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:35.560
I'm really sorry.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:36.230
Domon...

00:21:38.600 --> 00:21:39.360
I, uh...

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:41.770
It was all my fault!

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:42.650
I was...

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:47.740
We're friends here, aren't we?

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:48.870
Domon.

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:51.910
Um... is your shoulder
going to be okay?

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:55.370
My shoulder's not as weak
as you think.

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:58.710
Start training your body
while you're still young.

00:21:58.710 --> 00:21:59.830
And next time...

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:02.590
...maybe you'll be able to
pilot a Gundam.

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:05.550
Yes!

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:07.270
Good. That's the spirit.

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:11.260
Domon's friends, huh?

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:28.660
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:31.160
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:36.450
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:39.000
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:47.800
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:54.510
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.760 --> 00:23:02.060
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:06.610
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:10.200
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:10.240 --> 00:23:17.660
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:26.500
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:33.090 --> 00:23:35.010
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.350
Domon's next opponent is
Mandala Gundam of Neo Nepal.

00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:41.730
And the pilot of this
Gundam happens to be...

00:23:41.730 --> 00:23:43.810
...a professional assassin!

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:46.820
Domon has begun special
training and has created...

00:23:46.820 --> 00:23:50.320
...the God Slash, a new technique
to defeat the assassin!

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:52.990
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:57.040
Domon Targeted!
The Assassin's Staff

00:23:54.700 --> 00:24:01.350
Domon Targeted!
The Assassin's Staff

00:23:57.040 --> 00:23:59.500
Ready! Go!
